abstract: "A living threat repository where real-world cyber incidents are continuously mapped to MITRE ATT&CK tactics and techniques in a Navigator-style view. The platform helps defenders filter threat intelligence, open reports, highlight technique chains, and move into Attack Path and Hunt Pack views for deeper operational context."
